Port of _patches/typescript/009-execute-tsc-emit.patch (tsc/internal/execute/tsc.go, tsc/internal/execute/tsc/emit.go,
tsc/internal/compiler/program.go) to tsrs.

- CommandLine: tsrs_execute::execute::command_line_with_testing enters etscore's command-line mode for the call
  (`ets_etscore::enter_command_line_mode`, restored on return as Go's `defer restore()`). tsrs_execute depends on
  the workspace's ets_etscore crate, as Go's execute imports etscore (see patch 007).
- FilterDiagnosticsForExitCodeCallback / RegisterFilterDiagnosticsForExitCodeCallback:
  tsrs_execute::tsc::{FilterDiagnosticsForExitCodeCallback, register_filter_diagnostics_for_exit_code_callback} (an
  Arc'd closure behind a process-wide RwLock, as patch 002's callback); emit_and_report_statistics computes the exit
  status from the filtered diagnostics.
- FilterDiagnosticsForNoEmitOnErrorCallback / RegisterFilterDiagnosticsForNoEmitOnErrorCallback:
  tsrs_compiler::{FilterDiagnosticsForNoEmitOnErrorCallback, register_filter_diagnostics_for_no_emit_on_error_callback};
  get_diagnostics_of_any_program filters its result with it when skip_no_emit_check_for_dts_diagnostics is set.
  tsrs-only: tsrs has a second copy of GetDiagnosticsOfAnyProgram for non-compiler programs
  (programlike.rs get_diagnostics_of_any_program_like), which gets the same hunk.
- The callbacks take the diagnostics as a slice and return the kept ones (Go: a slice in, a slice out).

